# Project specific
# Run outputs are never tracked. Slice measurements are reproduced by running on
# FABRIC (notebooks fabric/01-05); the loopback sweeps by sweep.py / plots.py /
# decoy_sweep.py. Previously recorded evidence lives in git history, not the tree.
results/
qne-sequence/results/
secrets/
*.json
!p4/**/*.json
*.pcap

# Personal session tracking — never ship in the artifact
cc-usage-log.md

# Agent notes — contains bastion/account details for the live slice, keep local
CLAUDE.md

# Paper drafts + generated figures — kept local, regenerated via paper/make_figures.py
paper/

# Internal review notes — keep local, don't ship
REVIEW_*.md
!REVIEW_2026-09-21.md

# Intern-facing handouts — private, keep local
ASSIGNMENT_*.md
EXPLORATION.md

# FABRIC (slice) notebook variants — run locally, don't check in
notebooks/**/*_fabric.ipynb

